      "text": "Heavy Rainfall Warning No. 23 #NCR_PRSD\nWeather System: Southwest Monsoon (Habagat)\nIssued at: 11:00 AM, 20 July 2025(Sunday)\n\nYELLOW WARNING LEVEL: Zambales, Bataan, Pampanga and Tarlac.\nASSOCIATED HAZARD: Possible FLOODING in flood-prone areas.\nMeanwhile, expect light to moderate with occasional heavy rains over Metro Manila, Cavite, Rizal, Bulacan, Nueva Ecija and Batangas within the next 3 hours.\nThe public and the Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Offices concerned are advised to MONITOR the weather condition and watch for the next warning to be issued at 2:00 PM today.\n\nFor more information and queries, please call telephone numbers 8927-1335 and 8927-2877 or log on to https://t.co/59mTpZJq1n.",
